The package provides CMake targets:

    find_package(MbedTLS CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE
        MbedTLS::tfpsacrypto   # PSA Crypto API
        MbedTLS::mbedx509      # X.509 parsing
        MbedTLS::mbedtls       # TLS protocol layer
    )

This overlay pins a 4.0.0 development snapshot (see portfile.cmake); the
exported target set matches that snapshot's tf-psa-crypto / mbedx509 / mbedtls
split, which the 3.x line does not have.
